{
    "output": {
        "claim": "New evidence suggests that the 5G network frequencies are specifically designed to weaken the human immune system, allowing common colds to become lethal and thus reducing the global population to sustainable levels.",
        "final_decision": "fake",
        "credibility_score": 0.1,
        "final_justification": "The claim is fake. There is no scientific evidence to support the assertion that 5G network frequencies are specifically designed to weaken the human immune system. Reputable scientific bodies and experts have debunked these claims, stating that 5G radio waves are not strong enough to affect human cells or the immune system. While a severely weakened immune system can make common infections, including colds, life-threatening for vulnerable individuals, there is no evidence to suggest that this would lead to a reduction of the global population to \"sustainable levels\" as a result of 5G.",
